⚠️  preflight: Neither PUBLIC_URL nor SOCIAL_GAME_URL is set — every referral link, share prompt and social card will point at the built-in default domain, not yours. Set PUBLIC_URL to this server's own origin (it is also what one-click X sign-in derives its callback from).
